% ò¤ô
% A page whose only font is a whole (untagged) TrueType program, EmojiTest:
% the Roboto test font cut to one letter, whose cmap also maps U+1F600 to
% that glyph (a format 12 subtable). Rich text asking for the family with a
% supplementary character must resolve to this program on every platform,
% including one whose wchar_t is 16 bits and sees the character as a
% surrogate pair. Built with fontTools; the recipe is in the plan.
